title: "Symbolic IV: Discovering Structural Equations under Endogeneity"
abstract: "Symbolic regression scored by instrumental-variable moment conditions: candidate formulas from cheap generators, constants refitted by two-step GMM, selection by a GMM model-selection criterion with a per-node structure penalty, and an identification-robust confidence set over formulas. Code, Monte Carlo benchmark suite, run records and a replication guide."
